            <ArticleTitle>Traumatic vertebral artery rupture causing intraspinal hematoma and progressive neurological symptoms.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00701-017-3407-6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Traumatic vertebral artery rupture is extremely rare. Herein, we report a case of traumatic vertebral artery rupture causing extensive intraspinal hematoma and progressive neurological symptoms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
